    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🚀 Business Outreach Agent\n\n**Flow:**\n1. Trigger → Set your niche + city in **Search Config**\n2. Apify scrapes Google Maps for local businesses\n3. Leads are cleaned, deduped, and saved to Google Sheets\n4. AI scores each lead (High/Med/Low) and personalizes the hook\n5. Drop Cowboy sends a ringless voicemail to each qualified lead\n6. Google Sheets is updated with VM status\n\n**Credentials Needed:**\n- Apify API Token\n- Google Sheets OAuth2\n- OpenAI API Key\n- Drop Cowboy API Token\n\n**Before Running:**\n- Replace `YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID` in all Sheet nodes\n- Replace `YOUR_10_DIGIT_PHONE_NUMBER` in Search Config\n- Upload your voicemail MP3 and add the public URL\n- Create the 'Leads' sheet with correct column headers (see README)",
        "height": 400,
        "width": 500,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0020-0020-0020-a1b2c3d40020",
      "name": "Setup Notes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [200, 160]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ⚠️ No New Leads\nAll scraped businesses already\nexist in the sheet.\n\nTry a different city or niche\nin the Search Config node.",
        "height": 180,
        "width": 280,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0021-0021-0021-a1b2c3d40021",
      "name": "No New Leads Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [2380, 500]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🤖 AI Scoring\nGPT-4o-mini analyzes each lead:\n- Assigns High/Med/Low priority\n- Generates a personalized VM hook\n- Flags chains/franchises to skip\n\nSwap for Claude if preferred.",
        "height": 180,
        "width": 300,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0022-0022-0022-a1b2c3d40022",
      "name": "AI Note",
